      },
      "authorType": "TOPIC",
      "competitionRanking": 748,
      "content": "<p>I ran the base model (yes, the base model) over all the 9500 problems at least once. These are the results.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nemotron.huikang.dev/base\" target=\"_blank\">https://nemotron.huikang.dev/base</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F1680925%2Fc52362d70d95e25bcd2c90b32cb66e4a%2FScreenshot%202026-03-23%20at%2020.43.10.png?generation=1774323809172370&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>You can see the model generation as well.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.googleapis.com/download/storage/v1/b/kaggle-forum-message-attachments/o/inbox%2F1680925%2F2ec0a9bf244160a624ce832546c8454f%2FScreenshot%202026-03-23%20at%2020.52.27.png?generation=1774324365015607&amp;alt=media\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>The code is <a href=\"https://github.com/tonghuikang/nemotron\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>. This is derived from my work in <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/ai-mathematical-olympiad-progress-prize-3/discussion/672528\" target=\"_blank\">AIMO 3</a> and <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/arc-prize-2025/writeups/my-attempt-at-arc-agi-2\" target=\"_blank\">ARC-AGI-2</a>.</p>",
      "feedbackTrackingData": {},
      "id": 3427405,
      "isThankYou": false,
      "kernelVersion": 0,
      "parent": {},
      "postDate": "2026-03-24T03:34:27.017Z",
